B.RZ=new A.kL("chiller_monthly","Chiller operational PPM","\u0627\u0644\u0635\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0642\u0627\u0626\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0634\u063a\u064a\u0644\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0628\u0631\u062f","monthly","Review OEM maintenance and site work permit before work. Record chilled water supply/return temperatures and operating pressures; check alarms, accessible visual leaks, abnormal vibration and logs. Escalate unsafe conditions. This draft is not an OEM service procedure.")
B.RW=new A.kL("cooling_tower_monthly","Cooling Tower condition check","\u0641\u062d\u0635 \u062d\u0627\u0644\u0629 \u0628\u0631\u062c \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0628\u0631\u064a\u062f","monthly","Review site water safety plan and required access permits. Record available temperatures and water quality log references. Inspect accessible exterior fan/motor conditions, leaks, basin and distribution. Escalate microbiological risk; do not perform confined-space or energized work without specialist method statements and authorization.")
B.RY=new A.kL("pump_monthly","Pump condition monitoring","\u0645\u062a\u0627\u0628\u0639\u0629 \u062d\u0627\u0644\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0636\u062e\u0627\u062a","monthly","Check manufacturer guidance and isolation requirements. Record suction/discharge pressures, running status, visible leaks, motor current if safely available, vibration and unusual noises. Flag deviations for competent maintenance personnel.")
B.RV=new A.kL("electrical_monthly","Electrical panel external observation","\u0641\u062d\u0635 \u0638\u0627\u0647\u0631\u064a \u0644\u0644\u0648\u062d\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0647\u0631\u0628\u0627\u0626\u064a\u0629","monthly","External visual check only, without opening energized enclosures. Check signage, physical access, environmental conditions, warning indicators and maintenance records. Any internal testing requires qualified personnel and approved isolation procedures.")
